---
source: crates/ostro-cli/tests/p14_security_cli.rs
expression: t
---
$ ostro deploy TMP/orders.wasm --signature TMP/big.sig
error: signature file TMP/big.sig is 8193 bytes; at most 8192 bytes are accepted
[exit 2]
$ ostro deploy TMP/orders.wasm --signature TMP/empty.sig
error: signature file TMP/empty.sig is empty
[exit 2]
$ ostro deploy TMP/orders.wasm --signature TMP/s0.sig --signature TMP/s1.sig --signature TMP/s2.sig --signature TMP/s3.sig --signature TMP/s4.sig
error: 5 signature files given; at most 4 are accepted
[exit 2]
$ ostro deploy TMP/proj --signature TMP/a.minisig
error: --signature applies to a .wasm file (sign the built component and deploy it)
[exit 2]
